    "description": {
      "content": "The Push to Card API enables instant fund disbursements directly to Visa and Mastercard debit cards. Ideal for disbursements, refunds, and payouts up to $125,000 per transaction. Transactions are irrevocable and provide immediate access to funds for recipients.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: US Bank API Onboarding Team\n Email: apionboarding@usbank.com",
